    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$3.14 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e, which is the priciest recipe in this group. The mushrooms and red peppers are why, so read the shopping tips below before you commit.",
    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eThe mushrooms and red peppers are the whole story.\u003c/strong\u003e Together they are more than half the batch cost. Cut either one in half and this recipe drops into normal territory fast.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eGreen peppers instead of red saves real money.\u003c/strong\u003e Red peppers are just ripened green ones and they carry a hefty premium for it. Roasting sweetens either color.",
